{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/24a4fad589d2486c6a104d8968c9d876.poster.avif?t=1773174522\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/24a4fad589d2486c6a104d8968c9d876.webm?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/24a4fad589d2486c6a104d8968c9d876.mp4?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f In Backpack TD, you will forge your kingdom from humble beginnings to an unstoppable force. Combining the backpack mechanic with tower defense and card-based gameplay, this game challenges you to strategically develop your base, fuse powerful units, and defend against endless waves of enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/506365cf51d15076eae65ccddc7cc8ba.poster.avif?t=1773174522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/506365cf51d15076eae65ccddc7cc8ba.webm?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/506365cf51d15076eae65ccddc7cc8ba.mp4?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udddd\u200d\u2640\ufe0fStrategic Depth &amp; Insane Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead one of five unique rulers, each representing a different class, and craft your deck with powerful cards. Experiment with synergies, fuse units, and create devastating strategies to break the game and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.poster.avif?t=1773174522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.webm?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.mp4?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>Create Unstoppable Forces</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom's fate is in your hands. Grow your base, make fusions, pick augments and protect your kingdom. The stronger your kingdom, the tougher the enemies will become. Will you survive the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584580?t=1773174522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/dc48c6dbd3ab22156a4ce870468af80bfa0482f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773174522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/0522020acbf5bf5298b86e600e1cabf21be2689f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773174522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/0522020acbf5bf5298b86e600e1cabf21be2689f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773174522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharin