 different class, and craft your deck with powerful cards. Experiment with synergies, fuse units, and create devastating strategies to break the game and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.poster.avif?t=1773174522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.webm?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/extras/58a945f95b68915665362339f30a7c7e.mp4?t=1773174522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>Create Unstoppable Forces</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom's fate is in your hands. Grow your base, make fusions, pick augments and protect your kingdom. The stronger your kingdom, the tougher the enemies will become. Will you survive the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Violet Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584580/83f5ffc116446988aee6a75dcbaf23c59a16d53c/header.jpg?t=1773174522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584580/1171630559/f5ea20e4533b2e1f8cea9f4fe5d276166d4ed304/1756455286/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758272399","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584580/1171630559/f5ea20e4533b2e1f8cea9f4fe5d276166d4ed304/1756455286/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758272399","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584580/1171630559/f5ea20e4533b2e1f8